# Local-only: presentation binaries and meeting records. The built decks are
# unpublished, and MeetingAssets.pdf is a Zoom summary of the author review
# that carries a shareable recording link — neither belongs in a public
# repository. AUTHOR_REVIEW.md is the checked-in record of that meeting.
#
# Note this excludes the *artifacts*, not slides/ as a whole: the builders,
# speaker-note scripts and figures under slides/ are plain text and safe to
# track. Ignoring the whole directory would have hidden them too.
MeetingAssets.pdf
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.key
slides/*.pdf
slides/.codex-pptx-*/
wf-output/
submit/
